1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,265
Nepal today, in numbers.

2
00:00:02,265 --> 00:00:04,010
Twenty nine million people.

3
00:00:04,010 --> 00:00:11,341
More women than men, because over two million Nepalis, four fifths of them men, were abroad on census day.

4
00:00:11,341 --> 00:00:13,867
Life expectancy seventy one.

5
00:00:13,867 --> 00:00:15,403
Two children per woman.

6
00:00:15,403 --> 00:00:24,361
And maternal deaths down from five hundred and thirty nine to one hundred and fifty one per hundred thousand births, one of the fastest falls ever recorded.

